      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The point of trying is the sheer, stubborn refusal to let the wreckage define you, even if the fight feels utterly pointless right now. Rebuilding is a marathon, not a sprint, and sometimes the only victory is simply making it to the next breath without breaking. If the system is rigged, then your personal escape route is the only one you truly control. Let the weight of the world fall off you; you don't have to carry it all.",
      "source": "target",
